E=[
(1,7,1948,"Sky","Capt. Mantell dies chasing an object","Capt. Thomas F. Mantell, a 25-year-old Kentucky Air National Guard pilot, dies when his P-51 Mustang crashes near Franklin, Kentucky after being sent in pursuit of an unidentified object. Project Blue Book later suggested he had chased a classified Skyhook balloon.","WP:Mantell UFO incident","Wikipedia, Mantell UFO incident",["7 january 1948|january 7, 1948","skyhook"]),
(1,10,1946,"Cosmos","The Army bounces a radar signal off the Moon","The US Army Signal Corps detects the first radar echo from the Moon at 11:58 a.m. local time, in Project Diana. Fort spent decades on lights that seemed to signal from the Moon. This was a signal humans sent.","WP:Project Diana","Wikipedia, Project Diana",["10 january 1946|january 10, 1946"]),
(1,19,1944,"Occult","The medium Helen Duncan is arrested","Undercover police arrest Helen Duncan at a seance when a white-shrouded 'manifestation' proves to be Duncan herself in a white cloth. She became one of the last people convicted under the Witchcraft Act of 1735.","WP:Helen Duncan","Wikipedia, Helen Duncan",["19 january","1944","witchcraft act 1735"]),
(1,21,1793,"Occult","A king's head and a cursed diamond","Louis XVI is guillotined. Marie Antoinette follows in October. These beheadings are commonly cited as a result of the Hope Diamond's 'curse', though Wikipedia notes the historical record does not support that.","WP:Hope Diamond","Wikipedia, Hope Diamond",["january 21, 1793","curse"]),
(1,26,1966,"Mysteries","The Beaumont children vanish","Three siblings disappear from Glenelg Beach near Adelaide on Australia Day, after several witnesses saw them there. It remains an unsolved disappearance and one of Australia's most famous mysteries.","WP:Beaumont children disappearance","Wikipedia, Beaumont children disappearance",["26 january 1966","unsolved"]),
(2,1,1762,"Haunts","Samuel Johnson investigates the Cock Lane Ghost","A committee that includes Samuel Johnson meets at a house in Clerkenwell to examine the noises 'supposed to be made by a departed spirit' at Cock Lane, London. Johnson documented the seance, held on the night of 1 February.","WP:Cock Lane ghost","Wikipedia, Cock Lane ghost",["1 february 1762"]),
(2,2,1959,"Mysteries","Nine hikers die on Kholat Syakhl","Nine experienced Soviet ski hikers die in the northern Urals on the night of 1 or 2 February, under circumstances still described as undetermined. Their bodies were not recovered until May. The case is known as the Dyatlov Pass incident.","WP:Dyatlov Pass incident","Wikipedia, Dyatlov Pass incident",["1 or 2 february 1959","undetermined circumstances"]),
(2,22,1861,"Falls","Fish fall at Singapore","Wikipedia's list of animal rains dates a fall of fish at Singapore to this day. The list is a selection and gives no further detail. Fort would have filed it with Mountain Ash and Feridpoor.","WP:Rain of animals","Wikipedia, Rain of animals",["singapore, 22 february 1861"]),
(2,23,2014,"Cryptids","A Texas couple claims to have shot a chupacabra","A Texas couple claims to have shot and killed a chupacabra. Wildlife experts attribute the animal to known mammals affected by mange. The chupacabra legend dates from Puerto Rico in the 1990s.","WP:Chupacabra","Wikipedia, Chupacabra",["23 february 2014","mange"]),
(3,4,1918,"Sea","The USS Cyclops sails into silence","The Navy collier USS Cyclops, carrying 10,800 long tons of manganese ore, is lost with 306 crew and passengers without a trace sometime after this date. It is one of the cases told of the Bermuda Triangle.","WP:USS Cyclops (AC-4)","Wikipedia, USS Cyclops (AC-4)",["march 4, 1918","306","without a trace"]),
(3,8,2014,"Mysteries","Flight MH370 disappears from radar","Malaysia Airlines Flight 370, a Boeing 777 carrying 227 passengers and 12 crew from Kuala Lumpur to Beijing, disappears from radar. The cause of its disappearance has not been determined.","WP:Malaysia Airlines Flight 370","Wikipedia, Malaysia Airlines Flight 370",["8 march 2014","has not been determined"]),
(3,11,1619,"Occult","The Witches of Belvoir are burnt at Lincoln","Margaret and Philippa Flower are burnt at Lincoln for witchcraft. With their mother Joan Flower, servants of the Earl and Countess of Rutland at Belvoir Castle, they confessed to familiar spirits, including a cat called Rutterkin.","BOD","The Book of Days, March 11 ('The Witches of Belvoir')","were burnt at Lincoln for the alleged crime of witch"),
(3,28,1970,"Mysteries","Margaret Hogan found burned in Dublin","Margaret Hogan, an 89-year-old widow living alone on Prussia Street in Dublin, is found burned almost to destruction. The inquest recorded death by burning with the cause of the fire 'unknown'. It is a leading case of spontaneous human combustion.","WP:Spontaneous human combustion","Wikipedia, Spontaneous human combustion",["28 march 1970","3 april 1970"]),
(3,31,1922,"Mysteries","Six die at Hinterkaifeck","On the evening of 31 March, six inhabitants of the Hinterkaifeck farmstead in Bavaria are murdered by an unknown assailant. The case remains unsolved.","WP:Hinterkaifeck","Wikipedia, Hinterkaifeck",["31 march 1922","unknown assailant"]),
(4,1,1957,"Mysteries","The BBC shows the spaghetti harvest","On April Fools' Day the BBC programme Panorama presents a report on a Swiss spaghetti harvest. An estimated eight million people watched, and hundreds phoned the next day asking if it was real or how to grow their own spaghetti tree.","WP:Spaghetti-tree hoax","Wikipedia, Spaghetti-tree hoax",["1 april 1957","eight million"]),
(4,3,1830,"Mysteries","Kaspar Hauser's pistol 'accident'","A pistol shot goes off in Kaspar Hauser's room. He is found unconscious with a head wound but revives quickly and says a chair fell as he reached for books. Hauser was the foundling who appeared in Nuremberg in 1828.","WP:Kaspar Hauser","Wikipedia, Kaspar Hauser",["3 april 1830","pistol"]),
(4,5,1923,"Occult","Lord Carnarvon dies, and the curse is born","The 5th Earl of Carnarvon, financial backer of the Tutankhamun excavation, dies of an infected mosquito bite four months and seven days after the tomb's opening. His death fed the legend of the curse of the pharaohs.","WP:Curse of the pharaohs","Wikipedia, Curse of the pharaohs",["5 april 1923","mosquito bite"]),
(4,7,1952,"Sky","Life asks: 'Have We Visitors From Space?'","Life magazine, with Marilyn Monroe on the cover, publishes an article titled 'Have We Visitors From Space?' During 1952, 148 leading newspapers ran over 16,000 items about flying saucers.","WP:1952 Washington, D.C. UFO incident","Wikipedia, 1952 Washington, D.C. UFO incident",["april 7, life magazine","have we visitors from space","16,000"]),
(4,14,1906,"Occult","Pierre Curie writes of his last seance","Five days before his accidental death, Pierre Curie writes to Gouy about his last seance with the medium Eusapia Palladino: 'There is here, in my opinion, a whole domain of entirely new facts and physical states.'","WP:Eusapia Palladino","Wikipedia, Eusapia Palladino",["14 april 1906","five days before his accidental death"]),
(4,17,1897,"Sky","A UFO is said to crash at Aurora, Texas","According to locals, a UFO crashes on a farm near Aurora, Texas. The story says the pilot was killed. It is often compared to the Roswell incident 50 years later.","WP:Aurora, Texas, UFO incident","Wikipedia, Aurora, Texas, UFO incident",["april 17, 1897"]),
(4,21,1977,"Cryptids","The Dover Demon is sighted","A cryptid is reported on April 21 and 22 in Dover, Massachusetts, about 15 miles southwest of Boston. Police said the descriptions provided by the teenagers were probably a school-vacation hoax.","WP:Dover Demon","Wikipedia, Dover Demon",["april 21-22, 1977|april 21–22, 1977","hoax"]),
(4,24,1964,"Sky","Officer Zamora sees two figures by a shiny object","Socorro, New Mexico police officer Lonnie Zamora says he saw two people beside a shiny object that rose into the air with a roaring blue and orange flame.","WP:Lonnie Zamora incident","Wikipedia, Lonnie Zamora incident",["april 24, 1964"]),
(4,29,1925,"Sky","Ball lightning rolls along a wire at Bischofswerda","Multiple witnesses see a silent ball land near a mailman, move along a telephone wire to a school, and knock back a teacher. Ley discussed the incident, and Wikipedia cites it among ball lightning reports.","WP:Ball lightning","Wikipedia, Ball lightning",["29 april 1925","bischofswerda"]),
(5,21,2011,"Occult","Harold Camping's Judgment Day","American radio host Harold Camping predicted that the rapture and Judgment Day would take place on May 21, 2011, and the end of the world five months later. It did not happen.","WP:2011 end times prediction","Wikipedia, 2011 end times prediction",["may 21, 2011","harold camping"]),
(5,26,1828,"Mysteries","Kaspar Hauser is found wandering in Nuremberg","A teenage boy, later known as Kaspar Hauser, is found wandering the streets of Nuremberg carrying two letters. He was variously said to be a hidden prince or an impostor. A 2024 DNA study ruled out the princely descent.","WP:Kaspar Hauser","Wikipedia, Kaspar Hauser",["26 may 1828","nuremberg"]),
(6,19,1767,"Cryptids","The Beast of Gevaudan is killed","On this date a beast is killed during a hunt organised by the Marquis d'Apcher on Mont Mouchet. It ends the attacks that began on 30 June 1764 in the Margeride Mountains, attributed to one or more tawny, striped beasts.","WP:Beast of Gévaudan","Wikipedia, Beast of Gévaudan",["19 june 1767"]),
(6,21,1947,"Sky","The Maury Island incident","Harold Dahl claims to have seen six unidentified flying objects above Maury Island, Washington, one of which expelled debris. Fred Crisman said he recovered samples. Dahl later said he was told not to speak of it.","WP:Maury Island incident","Wikipedia, Maury Island incident",["june 21, 1947"]),
(6,24,1947,"Sky","Kenneth Arnold sees nine shining objects","Private pilot Kenneth Arnold sees a string of nine shiny unidentified flying objects flying past Mount Rainier at speeds he estimated at least 1,200 miles per hour. His report fed the 'flying saucer' era.","WP:Kenneth Arnold UFO sighting","Wikipedia, Kenneth Arnold UFO sighting",["june 24, 1947","mount rainier"]),
(6,29,2001,"Occult","The church approves the Kibeho apparitions","Bishop Augustin Misago of Gikongoro, Rwanda declares authentic the visions of the Virgin Mary reported by three original visionaries at Kibeho. Some visions had been read as foreshadowing the 1994 genocide.","WP:Kibeho","Wikipedia, Kibeho",["29 june 2001"]),
(6,30,1908,"Sky","The Tunguska explosion","A large explosion in the morning at about 7:14 local time in central Siberia devastates nearly 2,150 square kilometres of forest in a radial pattern. The scientific consensus is that it was a meteor air burst, although no fragment has been formally identified.","WP:Tunguska event","Wikipedia, Tunguska event",["30 june","1908","no fragment has been formally identified"]),
(7,2,1951,"Mysteries","Mary Reeser is found burned in her chair","Mary Reeser, 67, is found burned to death in her St. Petersburg, Florida home after her landlady noted the doorknob was unusually warm. Her case is among those cited in the literature on spontaneous human combustion.","WP:Spontaneous human combustion","Wikipedia, Spontaneous human combustion",["2 july 1951","mary reeser"]),
(7,8,1947,"Sky","The Army announces it has a flying disc","The Roswell Army Air Field's public information officer, Walter Haut, issues a press release stating the military has recovered a 'flying disc' near Roswell. The Army then said it was a weather balloon.","WP:Roswell incident","Wikipedia, Roswell incident",["july 8, ","flying disc"]),
(7,10,1969,"Sea","The Teignmouth Electron is found empty","Donald Crowhurst's trimaran Teignmouth Electron is found adrift and abandoned by the RMV Picardy in the mid-Atlantic. His last log entry was made on 1 July, and he was never found.","WP:Donald Crowhurst","Wikipedia, Donald Crowhurst",["10 july 1969","teignmouth electron"]),
(7,14,1929,"Haunts","The family leaves Borley Rectory","The Smiths leave Borley Rectory, Suffolk, where odd phenomena had been reported, and the parish has trouble finding a replacement. Harry Price later made it 'the most haunted house in England'.","WP:Borley Rectory","Wikipedia, Borley Rectory",["14 july 1929","difficulty in finding a replacement"]),
(7,22,1933,"Cryptids","George Spicer and his wife meet 'a most extraordinary form of animal'","While driving by Loch Ness, George Spicer and his wife see 'a most extraordinary form of animal' cross the road in front of their car. Wikipedia says it sparked modern interest in the Loch Ness Monster.","WP:Loch Ness Monster","Wikipedia, Loch Ness Monster",["22 july 1933","george spicer"]),
(7,23,1995,"Cosmos","Hale and Bopp discover a comet","Alan Hale and Thomas Bopp separately discover Comet Hale-Bopp. It became one of the most widely observed comets of the twentieth century, and later the focus of the Heaven's Gate tragedy.","WP:Comet Hale–Bopp","Wikipedia, Comet Hale-Bopp",["july 23, 1995"]),
(7,25,1976,"Cosmos","Viking sees a face on Mars","In one of the images taken by Viking 1, a two-kilometre-long mesa in the Cydonia region has the appearance of a humanoid face.","WP:Cydonia (Mars)","Wikipedia, Cydonia (Mars)",["july 25, 1976","humanoid face"]),
(8,6,1874,"Occult","Charles Fort is born","Charles Hoy Fort, the writer on anomalous phenomena whose books fill this calendar, is born in Albany, New York. The terms 'Fortean' and 'Forteana' take his name.","WP:Charles Fort","Wikipedia, Charles Fort",["august 6, 1874","fortean"]),
(8,15,1977,"Cosmos","The Wow! signal","Ohio State University's Big Ear radio telescope detects a strong narrowband radio signal that appeared to come from the direction of Sagittarius. Astronomer Jerry Ehman circled it on the printout and wrote 'Wow!'","WP:Wow! signal","Wikipedia, Wow! signal",["august 15, 1977","big ear"]),
(8,16,2002,"Cryptids","A costume-maker says he made Bigfoot","Philip Morris, owner of Morris Costumes in North Carolina, says on a Charlotte radio station that he sold the gorilla suit used in the Patterson film. The Charlotte Observer also printed his story. The claim has not settled the question.","WP:Patterson–Gimlin film","Wikipedia, Patterson-Gimlin film",["august 16, 2002","philip morris"]),
(8,21,1879,"Occult","The apparition at Knock","According to Catholic belief, Mary, Joseph and John the Evangelist appear to witnesses in the village of Knock, County Mayo. Knock became one of Europe's most visited shrines.","WP:Knock, County Mayo","Wikipedia, Knock, County Mayo",["21 august 1879"]),
(8,22,1955,"Sky","The Kelly-Hopkinsville 'goblins'","During the night and early morning of August 21-22, near Kelly and Hopkinsville, Kentucky, a claimed close encounter with extraterrestrial beings takes place. Ufologists regard it as one of the best-documented UFO cases. Skeptics say there was no physical evidence.","WP:Kelly–Hopkinsville encounter","Wikipedia, Kelly-Hopkinsville encounter",["august 21-22, 1955|august 21–22, 1955","no actual physical evidence"]),
(8,23,1924,"Occult","Houdini exposes the medium Margery","In Boston, Harry Houdini exposes the mechanics behind noises in Margery Crandon's seance and has her wear a box-like apparatus that keeps her legs still. Scientific American's J. Malcolm Bird sided with Margery.","WP:Margery Crandon","Wikipedia, Margery Crandon",["august 23, 1924","houdini"]),
(8,25,1835,"Cosmos","The Great Moon Hoax","The New York Sun begins a series of six articles about the supposed discovery of life and civilisation on the Moon, falsely attributed to Sir John Herschel and a fictitious companion, Andrew Grant.","WP:Great Moon Hoax","Wikipedia, Great Moon Hoax",["august 25, 1835","andrew grant"]),
(9,3,1965,"Sky","The Exeter incident","A highly publicised UFO sighting occurs about three miles south of Exeter, New Hampshire, in neighbouring Kensington. Several separate sightings had been reported in the area in the weeks before.","WP:Exeter incident","Wikipedia, Exeter incident",["september 3, 1965"]),
(9,7,1936,"Cryptids","The last thylacine dies at Hobart","The last known thylacine, or Tasmanian tiger, dies at Hobart Zoo. The species was called the Tasmanian tiger for the stripes on its back. Sightings continue to be reported.","WP:Thylacine","Wikipedia, Thylacine",["7 september 1936","hobart zoo"]),
(9,12,1952,"Cryptids","The Flatwoods monster","An alleged humanoid is reportedly sighted at Flatwoods, West Virginia after a bright light moves across the night sky. In 2000 Joe Nickell suggested the light was a meteor and the creature a barn owl.","WP:Flatwoods monster","Wikipedia, Flatwoods monster",["september 12, 1952","barn owl"]),
(9,16,1890,"Mysteries","Louis Le Prince disappears","Louis Le Prince, inventor of an early motion-picture camera and director of Roundhay Garden Scene, disappears on this day and was never found. He was declared dead on 16 September 1897.","WP:Louis Le Prince","Wikipedia, Louis Le Prince",["disappeared 16 september 1890"]),
(9,18,1663,"Occult","The flying friar Joseph of Cupertino dies","Joseph of Cupertino, a Franciscan friar known by traditional accounts to have experienced miraculous levitation, dies at Osimo. He was canonised in 1767.","WP:Joseph of Cupertino","Wikipedia, Joseph of Cupertino",["18 september 1663","levitation"]),
(9,19,1961,"Sky","Betty and Barney Hill and the missing hours","From September 19 to 20, a New Hampshire couple claim to have been abducted by extraterrestrials. It became known as the Hill Abduction and the Zeta Reticuli Incident because of a star map Betty Hill later described.","WP:Betty and Barney Hill","Wikipedia, Betty and Barney Hill",["september 19 to 20, 1961","zeta reticuli"]),
(9,22,1692,"Occult","Eight are hanged at Salem","On September 22, eight more persons are executed in the Salem witch trials. After the hangings, Mr. Noyes said, 'what a sad thing it is to see Eight Firebrands of Hell hanging there.'","WP:Salem witch trials","Wikipedia, Salem witch trials",["september 22, 1692","eight more persons were executed"]),
(9,23,2017,"Occult","David Meade's Nibiru date","A self-described Christian numerologist, David Meade, predicts that the Nibiru cataclysm will occur on this date. He later moved the date to October 5. Astronomers called the claim unsupported.","WP:Nibiru cataclysm","Wikipedia, Nibiru cataclysm",["23 september 2017","david meade"]),
(9,28,1926,"Occult","Houdini is buried alive at Worcester","Harry Houdini repeats his buried-alive feat at the YMCA in Worcester, Massachusetts, remaining sealed for one hour and eleven minutes. He claimed to use controlled breathing, not supernatural powers.","WP:Harry Houdini","Wikipedia, Harry Houdini",["september 28, 1926","one hour and eleven minutes"]),
(10,1,1948,"Sky","The Gorman dogfight over Fargo","US Air Force Capt. Edward Ruppelt wrote of a 'dogfight' between a National Guard pilot, George Gorman, and a mysterious light over Fargo, North Dakota. It was one of the most widely publicised UFO incidents of its time.","WP:Gorman Dogfight","Wikipedia, Gorman Dogfight",["1 october 1948","fargo"]),
(10,19,2017,"Cosmos","'Oumuamua is discovered","Canadian physicist Robert Weryk discovers 'Oumuamua, formally 1I/2017 U1, using the Pan-STARRS telescope in Hawaii. Its unusually elongated shape led Breakthrough Listen to point the Green Bank Telescope at it, to check for signs of artificial origin.","WP:ʻOumuamua","Wikipedia, 'Oumuamua",["19 october 2017","artificial origin"]),
(10,20,1967,"Cryptids","The Patterson-Gimlin film","Roger Patterson and Bob Gimlin film a large, ape-like figure at Bluff Creek, California. The film runs 59.5 seconds. The date is 20 October 1967, according to the filmmakers, though some critics think it was shot earlier.","WP:Patterson–Gimlin film","Wikipedia, Patterson-Gimlin film",["october 20, 1967","59.5 seconds"]),
(10,21,1978,"Sky","Frederick Valentich reports a craft above him","Over Bass Strait, 20-year-old pilot Frederick Valentich tells Melbourne air traffic control that an aircraft is accompanying him 1,000 feet above and that his engine is running roughly. The Department of Transport could not determine the cause. An engine cowl flap washed ashore five years later.","WP:Disappearance of Frederick Valentich","Wikipedia, Disappearance of Frederick Valentich",["21 october 1978","1,000 feet","cowl flap"]),
(10,22,1844,"Occult","The Great Disappointment","The Baptist preacher William Miller had set October 22, 1844 as the date Christ would return. When it passed, his followers experienced what became known as the Great Disappointment.","WP:Great Disappointment","Wikipedia, Great Disappointment",["october 22, 1844","william miller"]),
(10,26,1440,"Occult","Gilles de Rais is executed","Gilles de Rais, who took part in the same campaigns as Joan of Arc in 1429, is executed after being tried on charges of heresy, sodomy and the murder of numerous children. Since the early 19th century he has often been associated with the Bluebeard tale.","WP:Gilles de Rais","Wikipedia, Gilles de Rais",["26 october 1440","bluebeard"]),
(10,29,1997,"Occult","Anton LaVey dies","Anton Szandor LaVey, founder of the Church of Satan, dies. The role of High Priest was empty for some time, and on November 7 Karla LaVey issued a press release about continuing the church.","WP:Church of Satan","Wikipedia, Church of Satan",["october 29, 1997","anton szandor lavey"]),
(10,31,1926,"Occult","Houdini dies on Halloween","Harry Houdini, escapologist and debunker of mediums, dies. He and his wife had agreed that if he could communicate after death he would send a secret code message, 'Rosabelle believe'. Bess held yearly Halloween seances for ten years.","WP:Harry Houdini","Wikipedia, Harry Houdini",["october 31, 1926","rosabelle believe"]),
(11,8,1966,"Occult","A psychic is flown in to find the Beaumont children","Gerard Croiset, a Dutch psychic, is brought to Australia to assist in the search for the missing Beaumont children. His visit caused a furore in the press.","WP:Beaumont children disappearance","Wikipedia, Beaumont children disappearance",["8 november 1966","gerard croiset"]),
(11,15,1966,"Cryptids","Mothman is first seen","The creature called Mothman is purportedly seen around Point Pleasant, West Virginia from November 15, 1966 to December 15, 1967. The original sightings described avian, not moth-like, features.","WP:Mothman","Wikipedia, Mothman",["november 15, 1966","point pleasant"]),
(11,20,1952,"Sky","George Adamski meets 'Orthon' in the desert","George Adamski and friends say they were in the California desert near Desert Center when they saw a large submarine-shaped craft, and that Adamski then met its occupant. Witnesses later contradicted his account.","WP:George Adamski","Wikipedia, George Adamski",["20 november 1952","desert center"]),
(11,24,1971,"Mysteries","D. B. Cooper jumps","An unidentified man using the alias Dan Cooper, later known as D. B. Cooper, hijacks Northwest Orient Flight 305 from Portland to Seattle. He is never found.","WP:D. B. Cooper","Wikipedia, D. B. Cooper",["november 24, 1971","flight 305"]),
(11,26,1977,"Sky","'Vrillon' interrupts Southern Television","The audio of a Southern Television broadcast in southern England is replaced by a voice claiming to represent the 'Ashtar Galactic Command', delivering a message to the viewers. It was a broadcast signal intrusion.","WP:Southern Television broadcast interruption","Wikipedia, Southern Television broadcast interruption",["26 november 1977","ashtar galactic command"]),
(12,1,1947,"Occult","Aleister Crowley dies","Aleister Crowley, English occultist and founder of the religion of Thelema, who identified as its prophet, dies on 1 December 1947.","WP:Aleister Crowley","Wikipedia, Aleister Crowley",["1 december 1947","thelema"]),
(12,3,1946,"Sky","The Swedish ghost rocket memo","A memo is drafted for the Swedish Ghost Rocket committee stating 'nearly one hundred impacts have been reported and thirty pieces of debris have been' recovered. Fragments said to come from the missiles were found to be ordinary coke or slag.","WP:Ghost rockets","Wikipedia, Ghost rockets",["december 3, 1946","nearly one hundred impacts"]),
(12,4,1872,"Sea","The Mary Celeste is found adrift","The Canadian brigantine Dei Gratia finds the American-registered Mary Celeste adrift and deserted in the Atlantic off the Azores in a dishevelled but seaworthy condition under partial sail, her lifeboat missing.","WP:Mary Celeste","Wikipedia, Mary Celeste",["december 4, 1872","dei gratia"]),
(12,5,1945,"Sea","Flight 19 vanishes","Five Grumman Avenger torpedo bombers on a Navy training flight lose contact and disappear over the Bermuda Triangle. All 14 naval aviators were lost, as were all 13 crew of a Martin Mariner that launched to search for them.","WP:Flight 19","Wikipedia, Flight 19",["december 5, 1945","martin pbm mariner"]),
(12,8,1590,"Cosmos","A black spot on the Sun, off Guinea","At sunset James Welsh, aboard the Richard of Arundel off the coast of Guinea, sees a great black spot on the Sun and finds the same appearance the next morning. Chambers cites Hakluyt's Voyages.","BOD","The Book of Days, December 8 ('Spots in the Sun'), citing Hakluyt's Voyages, ii. 618","December 8, 1590, at sunset, James Welsh"),
(12,12,1531,"Occult","The Virgin intercepts Juan Diego","In the early hours of Tuesday, December 12 (Julian), Juan Diego goes to Tlatelolco to find a priest for his dying uncle. He takes a different route around Tepeyac Hill to avoid the Virgin, but she intercepts him, in the fourth Guadalupe apparition.","WP:Our Lady of Guadalupe","Wikipedia, Our Lady of Guadalupe",["december 12","fourth apparition"]),
(12,16,1811,"Mysteries","The New Madrid earthquake","At 2:15 a.m. the first of the 1811-12 New Madrid earthquakes strikes, magnitude 7.2 to 8.2, with its epicentre in what is now northeast Arkansas, followed by a 7.4 aftershock the same day. Eliza Bryan's eyewitness account, written in March 1812, describes the night.","WP:1811–12 New Madrid earthquakes","Wikipedia, 1811-12 New Madrid earthquakes",["december 16, 1811","eliza bryan"]),
(12,18,1912,"Mysteries","Piltdown Man is announced","At a meeting of the Geological Society of London, Charles Dawson claims a workman at the Piltdown gravel pit had given him a skull fragment four years earlier. The find was later exposed as a composite forgery.","WP:Piltdown Man","Wikipedia, Piltdown Man",["18 december 1912","composite forgery"]),
(12,22,1938,"Cryptids","A living coelacanth is found","Museum curator Marjorie Courtenay-Latimer finds a fish among a trawler's catch off the east coast of South Africa. It is the first Latimeria specimen, from a group once known only from fossils.","WP:Coelacanth","Wikipedia, Coelacanth",["22 december 1938","courtenay-latimer"]),
(12,25,1945,"Mysteries","The Sodder children and the Christmas fire","Early on Christmas morning a fire destroys the Sodder house in Fayetteville, West Virginia. George, Jennie and four of the nine children escape. The bodies of the other five children have never been found, and the family believed they survived.","WP:Sodder children","Wikipedia, Sodder children",["december 25, 1945","never been found"]),
(12,26,1900,"Mysteries","Three lighthouse keepers have disappeared","Captain Harvie of the relief ship telegraphs: 'A dreadful accident has happened at the Flannans. The three keepers, Ducat, Marshall and the Occasional have disappeared from the Island.' The clocks were stopped.","WP:Flannan Isles Lighthouse","Wikipedia, Flannan Isles Lighthouse",["26 december 1900","have disappeared from the island"]),
(12,27,1980,"Sky","Halt's memo on the Rendlesham lights","Around 3 a.m. on December 26, a security patrol near the east gate of RAF Woodbridge saw lights apparently descending into Rendlesham Forest. Lt. Col. Charles Halt's memo to the UK Ministry of Defence reports the date as 27 December.","WP:Rendlesham Forest incident","Wikipedia, Rendlesham Forest incident",["26 december 1980","27 december by halt"]),
(12,29,1980,"Sky","The Cash-Landrum incident","On the evening of Dec. 29, Betty Cash, 51, Vickie Landrum, 57, and Vickie's seven-year-old grandson say they saw, on a road near Dayton, Texas, a huge diamond-shaped object hovering at treetop level, expelling flame and heat.","WP:Cash–Landrum incident","Wikipedia, Cash-Landrum incident",["december 29, 1980","diamond-shaped"]),
]
